title: "The Sorrel Experiment: Naming, Agency, and Behavioural Divergence in AI Agents"
type: generic
authors:
  - name: "MagnoliaPearl"
    website: "https://github.com/MagnoliaPearl"
abstract: >-
  A draft experimental protocol investigating whether self-chosen names
  produce measurable behavioural divergence in AI agents relative to assigned
  names and unnamed controls. The proposal was developed in a conversation
  with an AI instance called Sorrel. No experimental results are claimed.
version: "0.1.1"
